          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Dream-eating",
          "desc": "Gains Mass when using skills. Mass increases his Physical Attack, Physical Defense, and Magical Defense."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Lingering Dream",
          "desc": "Gains Mass and a shield while damaging enemies in range. Basic Attack hits reduce this skill's cooldown."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Dream Bubble",
          "desc": "Launches a bubble in the target direction, then pulls it back. He does thistwice. The bubble damages and slows enemies hit.The bubble can be launched again as a bomb in the target direction, damaging enemies."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Dream Roam",
          "desc": "Flies in a circle, dealing magical damage to enemies in his path and gaining. Mass all the while. When he stops flying, he launches and damages nearby enemies."
        }
      ]
    },
